'''Golbah hive''' was a major [[city]]<ref name="AEYNTKUE">''[[Star Wars: Absolutely Everything You Need to Know, Updated and Expanded]]''</ref> on the [[planet]] [[Geonosis]] and a notable [[Geonosian hive|hive]] of the [[Geonosian]] [[species]]. It wielded huge influence over the world's [[Politics|political system]]<ref name="Encyclopedia" />&mdash;which included ten prime hives<ref name="Separatists">{{EncyclopediaCite|The Separatists}}</ref>&mdash;but was eventually destroyed.<ref name="AEYNTKUE" /> When the [[Galactic Empire]] [[Sterilization of Geonosis|sterilized]] Geonosis around [[9 BBY]],<ref name="Timelines">''[[Star Wars: Timelines]]''</ref> all bar [[Klik-Klak|one]] of the Geonosians on the world were [[Death|killed]].<ref name="Encyclopedia" />

==Behind the scenes==
In the current ''[[Star Wars]]'' [[canon]], Golbah hive was first mentioned in the [[2015]] reference book ''[[Star Wars: Absolutely Everything You Need to Know]]''.<ref name="AEYNTK">''[[Star Wars: Absolutely Everything You Need to Know]]''</ref> The [[Golbah hive/Legends|hive]] originated in the [[Star Wars Legends|''Star Wars'' Legends]] continuity, where it was mentioned in ''[[Geonosis and the Outer Rim Worlds]]'', a [[2004]] supplement for the ''[[Star Wars Roleplaying Game]]'' produced by [[Wizards of the Coast]].<ref name="GATORW">''[[Geonosis and the Outer Rim Worlds]]''</ref>

